{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀喻及似喻品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀遮詮品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現量品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為自比量品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為他比量品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現量品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為自比量品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀遮詮品"}
{"id": null, "n": "0184001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0184001", "type": "orig", "text": "費氏著書譯此頌文。首句中云 Tshad-mar gyur-pa 本意堪為量者。費譯量所化生。誤。見 History of Indian logic, P. 276。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0184002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0184002", "type": "orig", "text": "集量原名具云 Tshad-mahi mdo kun-las btus-pa。意謂從一切量本論集成者。舊解以為解釋諸量故名集量。誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0186003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0186003", "type": "orig", "text": "費氏著書引此本頌并有詳解。見 History of Indian logic, p. 277。頌第二句末勘奈旦本作 Bsres-paḥo。引文錯為 Mibsres-paho 遂以離分別與不屬名類為二事。大誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0186004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0186004", "type": "orig", "text": "此段同俱舍論。見寧刻本卷二。二十一頁左。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0186005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0186005", "type": "orig", "text": "金本末句作色為根行境。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0187006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0187006", "type": "orig", "text": "費氏著書以此句屬下。錯斷句讀謂。破瑜伽師現量之說。大誤。見 History of Indian logic. p. 278。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0188007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0188007", "type": "orig", "text": "此依原文 Phyi-rol-pahi don 譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0189008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0189008", "type": "orig", "text": "成唯識論具引此頌。見寧刻本卷二十七頁右。又參照佛地經寧刻本卷三。九頁左。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0189009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0189009", "type": "orig", "text": "次有一頌半說憶念亦具二相。後即廣破異義。皆從畧。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0191001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0191001", "type": "orig", "text": "見 History of Indian logic, p. 280。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0192002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0192002", "type": "orig", "text": "此段兩譯文異。今依寶本抄。次有二頌就勝論宗空等觸義辨比量不緣自相。今畧。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0192003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0192003", "type": "orig", "text": "費氏著書引此二句於破聲量一段中。別以果性。自性。不可得。釋因三相。勘論無文。殆係誤引法稱之說以為陳那當爾也。見 History of Indian logic. pp. 280-281, 288, 311。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0194004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0194004", "type": "orig", "text": "以下四頌破所比異義。費氏書中畧引其說。而有錯解。見 History of Indian logic, p. 281。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0196005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0196005", "type": "orig", "text": "原文音譯 Utpala 謂青蓮華也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0197006", "type": "orig", "text": "次有五頌半釋成因相與所相不離之義。後即廣破異說。皆從畧。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0199001", "type": "orig", "text": "見 History of Indian logic, p. 282。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0199002", "type": "orig", "text": "金本此段原文……bstan-bcos-la ma ltos-pa。譯意不待論宗。寶本無此不字 ma。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0199003", "type": "orig", "text": "費氏著書引此一頌而釋義不全。見 History of Indian logic, p. 282。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0200004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0200004", "type": "orig", "text": "次有三頌破正理宗及成難論所說異義。今畧。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0200005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0200005", "type": "orig", "text": "金本此句無不字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0200006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0200006", "type": "orig", "text": "兩本頌釋文皆不順。今取意抄。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0201007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0201007", "type": "orig", "text": "見 History of Indian logic, p. 283。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0202008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0202008", "type": "orig", "text": "此句唯見金本。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0202009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0202009", "type": "orig", "text": "金本此句云「餘復待成立」。與理門文合。而與釋不順。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0204010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0204010", "type": "orig", "text": "此段唯見金本。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0204011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0204011", "type": "orig", "text": "此二破頌數論二種比量。遮顯原云 bsal-te-ḥohs-pa 具相原云 rnam-ldan 意同舊云反破方便。順成方便。文釋繁廣。今刪。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0206012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0206012", "type": "orig", "text": "見 History of Indian logic, p. 285。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0206013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0206013", "type": "orig", "text": "Ibid., p. 283。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0207014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0207014", "type": "orig", "text": "此下一段兩本文異。今准理門抄意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0208015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0208015", "type": "orig", "text": "寶本此句作若一邊亦不離。連下文讀。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0209016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0209016", "type": "orig", "text": "寶本此句無教字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0209017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0209017", "type": "orig", "text": "此云無害從金本 Gnod-pa-med-pa 譯。次四頌半（金本三頌半）。以異門釋相違。後即廣破異說。皆從略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0212001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0212001", "type": "orig", "text": "金本自下三品皆無品名。費氏書依金本。而謂此為因喻品。係臆測之誤。見 History of Indian logic, pp. 276, 286。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0212002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0212002", "type": "orig", "text": "Ibid., p. 286。引此半頌。末字 nyid 錯作 nyis。遂以為因有二種。誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0212003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0212003", "type": "orig", "text": "此二句。金本作「是故遮止非。以為異品相」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0213004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0213004", "type": "orig", "text": "此段寶本文句。全同理門。隱晦難解。今從金本。合原作 rjes-hgro 通指二喻合法而言。奘譯理門乃分為合離二事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0213005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0213005", "type": "orig", "text": "金本此句作或如因法但說隨一。與奘譯理門同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0213006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0213006", "type": "orig", "text": "金本缺此句頌。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0213007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0213007", "type": "orig", "text": "費氏著書誤引此至下倒合有二云云。以為喻有二類之證。章句全錯。見 History of Indian logic, p. 286。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0214008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0214008", "type": "orig", "text": "Ibid., p. 286。引此文。未明决擇五分之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0214009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0214009", "type": "orig", "text": "Ibid., p. 287。誤以為破譬喻量。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0215010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0215010", "type": "orig", "text": "相類原文。寶本作 nyer-hjal。金本作 dpe-ba。今依理門擇。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0215011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0215011", "type": "orig", "text": "金本以此數字連下此復二字。為一句頌。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0215012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0215012", "type": "orig", "text": "金本缺此半頌。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0215013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0215013", "type": "orig", "text": "金本此段文句。全同理門。但與釋不順。今從寶本。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0215014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0215014", "type": "orig", "text": "次下數句。金本無文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0216015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0216015", "type": "orig", "text": "原文云合 rjes-su hgro-ba 併指同異二喻合法而言。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0217016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0217016", "type": "orig", "text": "次下廣破異說。今畧。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0220001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0220001", "type": "orig", "text": "History of Indian logic, pp. 288-9。釋此品。但列十四過類名目。開至不至相似為二。缺常住相似。無異相似衍無窮相似。配列梵名亦有錯誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0220002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0220002", "type": "orig", "text": "此句依金本抄。寶本意云。若非不成而相至者。所立已成。此是誰因。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0221003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0221003", "type": "orig", "text": "此處版本不明。寶本曲尼版作言覺二因中。奈旦版作覺因等中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0221004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0221004", "type": "orig", "text": "金本此句作 med-par rtogs-pa。意云分別為無。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223005", "type": "orig", "text": "以下奈旦版金本譯文脫畧。直接分別相似。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0225006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0225006", "type": "orig", "text": "此下奈旦版金本始有文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0227007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0227007", "type": "orig", "text": "金本此句作頌文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0228008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0228008", "type": "orig", "text": "此即觀所緣釋論所云因明者說有無相隨為因也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0228009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0228009", "type": "orig", "text": "金本文句全異。意云。增不成不定。於因是相似。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0228010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0228010", "type": "orig", "text": "金本譯音作 shintenttaka。如實論所謂尸利沙樹也。實是葛藤之類。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0229011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0229011", "type": "orig", "text": "寶本句末有相似 mtshuns 一字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0230012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0230012", "type": "orig", "text": "寶本無此名目。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231013", "type": "orig", "text": "金本此句全異。意云。如是則成大難。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231014", "type": "orig", "text": "此字諸本皆作 me-rtogs（無分別）。勘理門論。應是 mo-rtags（女聲）之誤。今改正。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231015", "type": "orig", "text": "原作 ma-nin-gi rtags 即中性聲也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231016", "type": "orig", "text": "正理畧分原作 rigs-pa -phra-mo。正理廣分原作 rigs-pa-brtag。依下所釋。此指正理經首卷及餘卷而言。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231017", "type": "orig", "text": "金本此句作正理勝論及數論諸廣分云云。與前各品所破次第相合。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0232018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0232018", "type": "orig", "text": "次有九言二頌。總結全論。從畧。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0236001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0236001", "type": "orig", "text": "今人木村泰賢解正理經負處。以為全同如實。於此負處。即沿用因與立義相違之名。勘集量論。正理經以宗違為宗過。如實論以為因過。不可混也。參照木村所著印度六派哲學。（九版本）四八七頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0237002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0237002", "type": "orig", "text": "參照宇井伯壽。印度哲學研究。第一卷。二二二至二二六頁。宇井以如實為一論總名。反質難為其一品。又以反質難為梵文 Jati（過類）翻譯。又以為墮負應與道理難等別行。皆誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0239003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0239003", "type": "orig", "text": "見費氏 History of Indian logic, pp. 115-116. A. B. Keith, Indian Logic and Atomism, p. 27。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0240004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0240004", "type": "orig", "text": "參照印度哲學研究。第二卷。四三八。四六五。五三九頁。印度六派哲學。四五四。四五五頁。二氏皆譯名為問題相似。但依藏譯作 skabsmtshuṅs 而不作 phyogs-daṅ-mtshuṅs 也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0240005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0240005", "type": "orig", "text": "參照印度哲學研究。第二卷。四三八。四六五。四六六。五三九。五四〇頁。又印度六派哲學。四五六。四五七頁。History of Indian logic, p. 64。宇井不審所立相似之意。以為非觸因不合。木村又解作循環論法。費氏又以與方便相似顛倒說之。皆誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0241006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0241006", "type": "orig", "text": "費氏書中引金本頌句云。我根意義四法相合。以為與現存經本不符。其實寶本此句。無此意字也。參照 History of Indian logic, p. 279. note。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0243007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0243007", "type": "orig", "text": "參照印度哲學研究。第一卷。二九一頁以下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0243008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0243008", "type": "orig", "text": "印度哲學研究。第一卷。一四～一六頁。Indian Logic and Atomism, p. 36。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0243009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0243009", "type": "orig", "text": "印度哲學研究。第三卷。四八七～四九一頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0243010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0243010", "type": "orig", "text": "印度哲學研究。第一卷。三三〇～三三二頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0244011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0244011", "type": "orig", "text": "宇井伯壽。The Vaiśeṣika Philosophy, pp. 9-10。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0244012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0244012", "type": "orig", "text": "參照印度哲學研究。第一卷。三〇六頁。The Vaiśeṣika Philosophy, pp. 156-157。但以為和合可攝一義和合。誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245013", "type": "orig", "text": "七種名數不全。勘四譯本翻譯名義大集。數論章。4580 以下有相類之名目。作害相屬。物主相屬。能所依相屬。因果相屬。分全相屬。亦祗五種。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245014", "type": "orig", "text": "A. B. Keith, Sāmkhya system, p. 104。高桑純天譯。印度哲學概論。三五一。三五二頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0245015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0245015", "type": "orig", "text": "Indian Logic and Atomism, p. 90。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0246016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0246016", "type": "orig", "text": "History of Indian logic, p. 278。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0246017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0246017", "type": "orig", "text": "翻譯名義大集。彌曼薩章。4586。全同此文寶本。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0235a0501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0235a0501", "type": "add", "text": "緣【CB】，綠【補編】"}
